            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/tokens/anon",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "token": "{{bearerToken}}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Deprecated - use GET /api/metadata/anon-key instead. Returns the project's opaque anon key (`anon_...`) under the legacy `accessToken` field for backward compatibility. The anon key is a non-secret client identifier that maps requests to the `anon` role; it replaces the former non-expiring anonymous JWT and can be rotated via POST /api/secrets/anon-key/rotate (admin only)."
        },
